        {"zh": "我的花盘朝你的方向转", "en": "My flower face turns toward you."},
        {"zh": "这一片是我的土。", "en": "This soil is mine."},
        {"zh": "压低身子，花瓣都闭了。", "en": "Crouched low. Petals closed."},
        {"zh": "藤在你脚边。", "en": "The vine is at your feet."},
        {"zh": "我把藤收紧了。", "en": "I tighten."},
        {"zh": "现在就缠紧。", "en": "Now draw tight."},
        {"zh": "我这就缠上去。", "en": "Coil."},
        {"zh": "藤从土里拱出来。", "en": "Vines push up out of the soil."}
